WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 1.8 · Strategic Foundations
Positioning and comparative advantage

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Positioning shows why you, rather than someone else, and what you will not do.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Name an advantage you can prove.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Say who you serve and how.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. List what you will decline or refer.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“The only bakery in the district combining a paid apprenticeship with a recognised baking certificate. No unpaid internships.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your positioning statement and the choices it implies.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
